    "paragraphs": [
      "The big holidays usually go without an article: an Weihnachten, zu Ostern, an Silvester. In the south people say an, in the north often zu.",
      "In Germany presents come on Christmas Eve (Heiligabend), and the 25th and 26th December are both public holidays."
